sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant LG   as Load Generator
    participant MS   as Microservices
    participant PROM as Prometheus
    participant LOKI as Loki
    participant TEMP as Tempo
    participant GRAF as Grafana Cloud
    participant ALRT as Alerting Engine
    participant MCP  as MCP Server
    participant AGT  as agent_openai.py
    participant LLM  as OpenAI LLM
    participant ADM  as Administrator

    LG->>MS: Simulate user traffic
    MS->>PROM: Expose metrics (latency, errors, CPU)
    MS->>LOKI: Stream application logs
    MS->>TEMP: Emit distributed traces
    PROM->>GRAF: Metrics scraped and stored

    LG->>MS: Traffic spike or fault injected
    MS-->>MS: Service failure e.g. cartservice down
    MS->>PROM: Increased error rate, latency spike
    MS->>LOKI: Error log lines

    PROM->>GRAF: Updated metrics arrive
    GRAF->>ALRT: Evaluate alert rules
    ALRT->>ALRT: Threshold exceeded, state Firing

    ADM->>AGT: python agent_openai.py --triage
    AGT->>MCP: stdio_client.initialize()
    MCP-->>AGT: Full tool list returned
    AGT->>AGT: Filter to alert, loki, log, tempo, trace tools
    AGT->>MCP: list_loki_label_names
    MCP-->>AGT: Known labels returned

    AGT->>LLM: System prompt + triage query + tool schemas
    LLM->>AGT: function_call list_alert_rules
    AGT->>MCP: list_alert_rules
    MCP-->>AGT: Firing alerts returned
    AGT->>LLM: Tool result appended

    LLM->>AGT: function_call query_loki_logs
    AGT->>MCP: LogQL query for error logs
    MCP-->>AGT: Error log lines with timestamps
    AGT->>LLM: Tool result appended

    LLM->>AGT: function_call tempo_traceql_metrics_range
    AGT->>MCP: TraceQL rate by service.name
    MCP-->>AGT: Span-rate timeseries returned
    AGT->>LLM: Tool result appended

    LLM-->>AGT: Final analysis, no more function calls

    Note over LLM,AGT: Alert Summary, Root Cause Analysis,<br/>Recommended Actions

    AGT->>ADM: Print Markdown report to terminal

    ADM->>ADM: Review report and Grafana dashboard
    ADM->>MS: kubectl rollout restart deployment
    MS->>PROM: Error rate drops, latency recovers
    PROM->>GRAF: Metrics updated
    ALRT->>ALRT: Alert resolves, state Normal

    ADM->>AGT: Follow-up query - are all services healthy
    AGT->>LLM: Re-query with updated context
    LLM-->>ADM: All alerts resolved, traffic nominal